<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4232" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλῐνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of salt</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χόνδροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.185
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖχοι</span> ibid.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					16.3.3
				</span></i>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλῐνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίνον</span>)
				<i>without net</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. θήρα</span>
			game <i>not caught with net,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.244
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Apollonid.
			</span></i>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλινσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλειψις,
				τοῦἐργαστηρίου</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				4.1484.39
			</span></i> (Epid.). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλιντος:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμιλλα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλίνω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλέω</span> A) 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπτύνω</span>
			, <i>pound</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				995
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλινεῖν</span> (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλίνειν</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">:
				ἀλείφειν</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλῖναι:
				ἐπαλεῖψαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (cf.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλινσις</span>, Lat.
			<i>lino</i>).</div>
